## Configuration

`nextflow.config` has the BioBB properties (`ext.properties`) and output extensions (`ext.outputs`) of every step{% if labels %}, and the CPUs of the multithreaded steps ({{ labels | join(", ") }} label){% endif %}. Change them there or in a config file given with `-c`.{% if mpi_steps %} The MPI properties of the python workflow (`mpi_bin`, `mpi_np` and the MPI `binary_path`) are left out, because the biocontainers have no MPI: add them back to run {{ mpi_steps | join(", ") }} with MPI in your own environment.{% endif %}

